name=Animals Attack Zombies
id=AnimalsAttackZombies
author=Tien
description=Livestock that would stand up to a predator in real life now stand up to zombies.
description=- Bulls, boars, rams, roosters and turkey toms defend themselves and their herd or flock.
description=- Sows with piglets and cows with calves defend their young.
description=- They size zombies up and warn before charging, and run from crowds and when hurt.
description=- Fighting zombies does not stress them, so no broken pens.
description=Every other animal still runs. Each species can be turned off in the sandbox options.
description=Must be installed on both the server and clients.
